"""
Haircut Margin Calculator — self-contained web app.
====================================================
Everything is in TWO files: this one + index.html (which must sit next to it).
The IIFL haircut master is embedded, so the app works out of the box.

DEPLOY
  1. pip install pandas numpy openpyxl rapidfuzz pdfplumber \
       fastapi "uvicorn[standard]" python-multipart
  2. python haircut_app.py            # serves on http://0.0.0.0:8000
     (or: uvicorn haircut_app:app --host 0.0.0.0 --port 8000 --workers 1)

  - Set the PORT env var to change the port.
  - All haircut data is stored in a SQLite file `haircut.db`, created next to
    this file on first run. Its location MUST be writable. If the app's
    directory is read-only (e.g. some containers), set the HAIRCUT_DB env var
    to a writable path (e.g. HAIRCUT_DB=/data/haircut.db).
  - Re-uploading a haircut master with the same name REPLACES its data.
  - No authentication: host behind a VPN or an authenticating reverse proxy.
  - Run a SINGLE worker (user sessions are held in memory).
"""
